{"ASK_DRINK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Got half a bottle of wine - don't tell the kids","A drink? We drank the last of the whiskey on Tuesday - sorry","Booze? Oh, honey, I wish, there's a bottle somewhere in the county with my name on it","Whiskey? I've been dreaming about it, a shot, a sip, a single drop","I'm teetotal, always was, but I understand if you aren't, the world's a lot to take sober","A beer? Ha! what I wouldn't give for a cold beer on a hot day","Got a little moonshine, from a neighbor, it'd strip paint, but it'd also dull the edges","Nope, nothing, the shelves are bare, and so's my throat","No drinking, no, we need our heads clear, but I've been tempted"}},
