{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The evacuation was on the sixth, buses, school buses, the whole line, we missed it, we were at my sister's, we missed it","They said buses would come... we waited all day -- they never came","The roads out are blocked, soldiers, concrete barriers, a bulldozer pushed a car across, I saw it","Quarantine -- they call it quarantine, like we're a ship, like we're sick, like we're the problem","We tried to leave, we TRIED, they turned us around at the checkpoint, said nobody gets out","I heard a convoy took the old people and the sick, but the rest of us, we're on our own","We packed every single thing, and the radio said stand by for further instructions... that was days ago","Evacuation? I heard buses, but I never saw one, did you? Please say you saw one","They said evacuation, then the roadblocks went up, now I don't know what to believe","Maybe they'll come back for us, maybe, that's what I tell myself"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Evac's over, whoever got out, got out, and whoever didn't, didn't","There was one, they said, early, people lined up at the high school, I wasn't one of them","The line is still up... they say, a ring around the county, no one in, no one out..","Some folks slipped through, back roads, farm trails, I've heard they made it to Indiana","The only way out is by river... and the river's no safer","I think the quarantine was meant to keep it in, not keep us safe","Evacuation? The only thing that got evacuated was my patience","They said buses, then more buses, then nothing, so I'm not holding my breath"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"T-they said evacuate, then they said shelter in place, then they said evacuate, I don't know which is right","We're waiting for the evacuation notice, they said it would come by radio"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"You want out? get in line, behind everyone else","Evacuation? ha! try it, see where it gets you","If I knew a way out, do you think I'd be standing here? Keep your distance"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","role=militia",{"Quarantine line is a cordon around the county, thin in places, but deadly, don't try to cross","Orders were to hold, no one passes, I heard them shoot, I heard the screams"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","role=rescue_medical",{"Evacuation prioritized the critical, and the critical left, those of us who stayed are the stubborn ones"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","role=civilian_loner",{"I know the trails, I could get you out, but I wouldn't, the other side isn't any better"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"They said to wait for the buses, so I'm waiting","I've packed a bag, two bags, and I'm ready to go the minute they say"}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"I think we missed it...","The buses came and went on the sixth"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the evacuation, I mean",afterMs=3500},{t="nobody told us",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="we were asleep",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"The evacuation was ages ago","Nobody's evacuating now, they're just trying to survive"},false,false,{[1]={{t="if you weren't on it, you weren't on it",afterMs=3500}}}},
