{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Evacuation? The roads closed on day two, anyone who tried got turned around or shot","Last buses left Friday night, packed so full people were hanging off the sides","I tried to get out, the Army told me go back, I said no, they raised their rifles, so I went back","Why leave? I got everything I need right here","Evacuate to where? Louisville's worse, Fort Knox is sealed, there's nowhere left","You wait for an evacuation, you'll be waiting till you're dead, and then you'll be the thing they're evacuating from"}},
