{"ASK_EVACUATION","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Quarantine line at the river, Army turned everybody around, no exceptions","I rode to the line to see for myself, they had machine guns, I turned around","They said evacuate, they closed the roads, then they went home, brilliant"}},
